            "description": "## 创建知识库\n\n`POST /v1/projects/{projectID}/knowledge-bases`\n\n需要项目访问权（项目成员或租户 `platform_admin`）。将返回的 `id` 写入 `kb_id`。",
            "body": {
              "mode": "raw",
