    {
      "name": "09 网关运行时",
      "item": [
        {
          "name": "对话补全（OpenAI 兼容）",
          "request": {
            "method": "POST",
            "header": [
              {
                "key": "Content-Type",
                "value": "application/json"
              },
              {
                "key": "Authorization",
                "value": "Bearer {{api_key_secret}}"
              }
            ],
            "url": "{{gateway_base}}/v1/chat/completions",
            "description": "## 对话补全\n\n`POST http://127.0.0.1:8081/v1/chat/completions`\n\n使用员工 API Key。AiGate 做配额预检后转发上游（如阶跃 StepFun）。\n\n### 实测要点\n- 成功：HTTP 200，响应头 `X-Trace-Id`，`api_logs` 与 `audit_events` 记录\n- 配额不足：HTTP 429，`error.code=quota_exhausted`，`blocked=true`\n- 未传 `max_tokens` 时预占 **256** output；建议显式传 `max_tokens`\n\n### 阶跃可用模型（示例）\n`step-3.5-flash`、`step-3.7-flash`、`step-router-v1`",
            "body": {
              "mode": "raw",
              "raw": "{\n  \"model\": \"step-3.5-flash\",\n  \"messages\": [\n    {\n      \"role\": \"user\",\n      \"content\": \"请只回复：HELLO_AIGATE\"\n    }\n  ],\n  \"max_tokens\": 64\n}"
            }
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "Claude Messages 兼容",
          "request": {
            "method": "POST",
            "header": [
              {
                "key": "Content-Type",
                "value": "application/json"
              },
              {
                "key": "Authorization",
                "value": "Bearer {{api_key_secret}}"
              }
            ],
            "url": "{{gateway_base}}/v1/messages",
            "description": "## Claude Messages 兼容\n\n`POST http://127.0.0.1:8081/v1/messages`\n\n- 请求按 Claude Messages 形态传入（**必须**含 `max_tokens`）\n- 网关内部转成 OpenAI chat completions 再转发当前启用渠道\n- 成功响应改写成 Claude message 形态（`type=message`）",
            "body": {
              "mode": "raw",
              "raw": "{\n  \"model\": \"step-3.5-flash\",\n  \"max_tokens\": 64,\n  \"system\": \"只输出要求的短文本\",\n  \"messages\": [\n    {\n      \"role\": \"user\",\n      \"content\": \"请只回复：HELLO_AIGATE\"\n    }\n  ]\n}"
            }
          }
        }
      ]
    }
  ]
